Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:01:41.94,HEADA,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\c&H8CDC4A&}▍{\r\fn得意黑}2026 辛辛那提 WTA1000 女单1/4决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:01:41.94,HEADB,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\c&H8CDC4A&}高芙 {\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\c&H8CDC4A&\fs44}6-{\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\fs44}2 {\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\c&H8CDC4A&\fs44}6-{\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\fs44}2{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC} 科斯秋克 · 赛后场上采访
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.72,EN,,0,0,0,,It's about when there's
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,一般都是网前握手不太友好时
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.72,0:00:02.24,EN,,0,0,0,,an unfriendly handshake at the net.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.72,0:00:02.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,大家才会拿出来说
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.24,0:00:03.04,EN,,0,0,0,,I think we needed to talk
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.24,0:00:03.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,但这次这么友好
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.04,0:00:04.56,EN,,0,0,0,,about how friendly that was.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.04,0:00:04.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,我觉得也值得聊聊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.56,0:00:05.80,EN,,0,0,0,,It was a lot of smiles,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.56,0:00:05.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,两个人一直在笑
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.80,0:00:07.36,EN,,0,0,0,,a lot of respect for each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.80,0:00:07.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,也都非常尊重对方
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.36,0:00:10.16,EN,,0,0,0,,Shows how classy you are as a player.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.36,0:00:10.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,看得出你是个很有风度的球员
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.16,0:00:12.96,EN,,0,0,0,,No, yeah, Marta is a a great opponent
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.16,0:00:12.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,是的 玛尔塔是个很棒的对手
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.96,0:00:13.96,EN,,0,0,0,,or opponent.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.96,0:00:13.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,不 对手……
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.96,0:00:14.88,EN,,0,0,0,,I meant to say person.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.96,0:00:14.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,我想说的是人
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.88,0:00:16.88,EN,,0,0,0,,Also a a tough opponent, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.88,0:00:16.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,也是个很难打的对手
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.88,0:00:18.72,EN,,0,0,0,,But no, she's someone I have a lot
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.88,0:00:18.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,总之 她是我非常
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.72,0:00:19.40,EN,,0,0,0,,of respect for.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.72,0:00:19.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,尊重的人
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.40,0:00:20.28,EN,,0,0,0,,Even before the match,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.40,0:00:20.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,比赛开始前
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.28,0:00:22.48,EN,,0,0,0,,we were chatting about US Open.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.28,0:00:22.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,我们还在聊美网
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.48,0:00:24.84,EN,,0,0,0,,So, she's definitely one
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.48,0:00:24.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以我觉得她绝对是巡回赛里
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.84,0:00:26.12,EN,,0,0,0,,of I think the most talented
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.84,0:00:26.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,最有天赋的球员之一
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.12,0:00:28.84,EN,,0,0,0,,and athletic players on tour and yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.12,0:00:28.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,身体能力也非常出色
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.84,0:00:30.84,EN,,0,0,0,,tonight I just played really well
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.84,0:00:30.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,今晚是我自己打得很好
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.84,0:00:32.08,EN,,0,0,0,,and you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.84,0:00:32.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,而且你也知道
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.08,0:00:33.72,EN,,0,0,0,,a lot of respect cuz I know it wasn't
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.08,0:00:33.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,我很尊重她 因为我知道今晚
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.72,0:00:34.44,EN,,0,0,0,,her best night,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.72,0:00:34.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,她没有打出最好水平
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.44,0:00:36.00,EN,,0,0,0,,but obviously great sportsmanship
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.44,0:00:36.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,但她展现了很好的体育精神
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.00,0:00:36.72,EN,,0,0,0,,from her.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.00,0:00:36.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,这点很难得
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.72,0:00:37.76,EN,,0,0,0,,It was a great night for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.72,0:00:37.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,今晚对你来说很精彩
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.76,0:00:39.52,EN,,0,0,0,,You're through to another Masters 1000.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.76,0:00:39.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,你又一次闯进1000赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.52,0:00:41.44,EN,,0,0,0,,You do so well in the 1000s.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.52,0:00:41.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,你在1000赛总是打得很好
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.44,0:00:43.16,EN,,0,0,0,,What is it about these kind of tournaments
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.44,0:00:43.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,这类赛事有什么特别之处
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.16,0:00:45.12,EN,,0,0,0,,that bring out the best in you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.16,0:00:45.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,能让你打出最好的自己？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.12,0:00:46.20,EN,,0,0,0,,Definitely playing in front
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.12,0:00:46.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,当然少不了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.20,0:00:47.48,EN,,0,0,0,,of this home crowd.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.20,0:00:47.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,主场观众的支持
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.48,0:00:49.40,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.48,0:00:49.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.40,0:00:51.44,EN,,0,0,0,,Shout out to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.40,0:00:51.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,特别要谢谢……
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.44,0:00:52.84,EN,,0,0,0,,I don't know who was saying I'm in love
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.44,0:00:52.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,不知道刚才是谁在喊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.84,0:00:54.96,EN,,0,0,0,,with the Coco, but I like that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.84,0:00:54.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,「我爱Coco」 但我很喜欢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.96,0:01:00.80,EN,,0,0,0,,You guys are the best. That was a good one.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.96,0:01:00.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,你们太会了 这句喊得好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.80,0:01:02.24,EN,,0,0,0,,And it's the right Coco.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.80,0:01:02.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,而且喊的是对的那个Coco
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.24,0:01:07.16,EN,,0,0,0,,So Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.24,0:01:07.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以……抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.16,0:01:08.28,EN,,0,0,0,,I was Never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.16,0:01:08.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,我刚才……算了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.28,0:01:09.04,EN,,0,0,0,,Next question.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.28,0:01:09.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,下一个问题吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.04,0:01:11.20,EN,,0,0,0,,Okay, next question.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.04,0:01:11.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,好 下一个问题
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.20,0:01:12.68,EN,,0,0,0,,You're making me blush.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.20,0:01:12.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,你们都把我说脸红了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.68,0:01:14.08,EN,,0,0,0,,But let's just talk a little bit
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.68,0:01:14.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,还是来聊聊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.08,0:01:15.08,EN,,0,0,0,,about your level of play.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.08,0:01:15.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,你现在的竞技状态吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.08,0:01:16.20,EN,,0,0,0,,You're in such a good place.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.08,0:01:16.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,你现在处在很好的位置
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.20,0:01:17.40,EN,,0,0,0,,You're moving around the court great.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.20,0:01:17.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,场上移动也很出色
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.40,0:01:18.68,EN,,0,0,0,,You're serving well. What are you happiest
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.40,0:01:18.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,发球同样很好 打进半决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.68,0:01:20.80,EN,,0,0,0,,with about moving into the semifinals
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.68,0:01:20.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,准备迎战萨拉时
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.80,0:01:21.76,EN,,0,0,0,,against Sara?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.80,0:01:21.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,你最满意的是哪一点？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.76,0:01:21.96,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.76,0:01:21.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.96,0:01:24.04,EN,,0,0,0,,I think just staying aggressive today.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.96,0:01:24.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,今天我一直主动进攻
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.04,0:01:25.48,EN,,0,0,0,,Marta's someone who can take control
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.04,0:01:25.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,玛尔塔很容易就能掌控
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.48,0:01:27.56,EN,,0,0,0,,of the point very easily and I was just trying
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.48,0:01:27.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,一分球的主动 所以我努力
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.56,0:01:29.64,EN,,0,0,0,,to do my best to defend the balls I needed
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.56,0:01:29.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,在该防守的球上尽力顶住
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.64,0:01:30.64,EN,,0,0,0,,to and then be aggressive
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.64,0:01:30.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,有机会时再主动进攻
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.64,0:01:32.52,EN,,0,0,0,,when I could and obviously the next match
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.64,0:01:32.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,至于下一场
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.52,0:01:33.68,EN,,0,0,0,,is going to be tough against Sara.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.52,0:01:33.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,对萨拉肯定会很难打
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.68,0:01:35.04,EN,,0,0,0,,She's had some incredible wins,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.68,0:01:35.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,她赢下了几场精彩的比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.04,0:01:36.52,EN,,0,0,0,,but I'm looking forward to the challenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.04,0:01:36.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,但我很期待这个挑战
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.52,0:01:38.12,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we can't wait to see what's in store.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.52,0:01:38.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,我们也等不及看接下来会怎样
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.12,0:01:39.28,EN,,0,0,0,,Ladies and gentlemen, Coco Gauff.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.12,0:01:39.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,女士们先生们 高芙
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.28,0:01:40.20,EN,,0,0,0,,Let's hear it for her. Through
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.28,0:01:40.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,把掌声送给她 她已经
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.20,0:01:41.94,EN,,0,0,0,,to the semifinals.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.20,0:01:41.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,打进半决赛
